Recurring invoice objectives

Pin a reusable skill and an immutable objective to an existing owner-issued execution grant. Each live check uses the ordinary workflow engine, connection permissions and cost controls.

External customer contact is unavailable in this release. An open invoice pauses visibly for the owner; Crank never reports a message as sent. Paid, closed and void invoices stop.

